Located in Vila Nova de Poiares, this modern three-bedroom apartment on the first floor, featuring a private enclosed garage for two cars, has been designed for those who value comfort and quality of life.

Whether you are looking for a permanent residence or an investment opportunity, this property offers the perfect balance between tranquillity and convenience, with excellent access to Coimbra and surrounded by the region's beautiful natural landscapes.

Features:

- Master suite with walk-in wardrobe;

- Two additional bedrooms;

- Two bathrooms;

- Open-plan living room and kitchen;

- Fully fitted and equipped kitchen;

- Balcony with a gross area of 18.7 m²;

- Private enclosed garage for two cars.

Don't miss the opportunity to enjoy a high-quality lifestyle in one of the most peaceful areas of the region, just a few minutes from Coimbra.

Schedule your viewing today and discover what could become your new home. We look forward to welcoming you!

Additional three-bedroom apartments, as well as two-bedroom apartments, are also available in the building.

